# Line-ending policy (docs/architecture.md §13). Everything text is stored AND checked out as LF,
# so Windows working copies never feed CRLF into Docker/bash/git apply.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

# Patches must never be rewritten by Git.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
